\title{Applr: Tools for Visualizing and Explaining Linear Models}
\description{
Applr is a small R package that makes it easy to visualize slices of
higher-dimensional linear models and to present model equations clearly.
It includes base R and ggplot2 helpers, plus an interactive 3D view for
models with two predictors.
}
\details{
Core capabilities:
\itemize{
\item 2D slices of multi-variable models in base graphics
\item ggplot2 layer for plotting model slices across facets
\item Interactive 3D scatter with fitted surface (two predictors)
\item Quick text/LaTeX equations from lm() objects
}
}
